{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23828","headline":"夜招晦叔 · 白居易","name":"夜招晦叔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭草留霜池结冰，黄昏钟绝冻云凝。\n碧毡帐上正飘雪，红火炉前初炷灯。\n高调秦筝一两弄，小花蛮榼二三升。\n爲君更奏湘神曲，夜就侬来能不能。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}